fn gui_rgba8888_compositor_tile_rle_present_host_execution_driver_error_new %fn GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentHostExecutionDriverErrorKind fn Option GuiError fn GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentDispatchLoopState GuiRgba8888CompositorTileRlePresentHostExecutionDriverError \kind\category\state:
